        <Param val="MilliKey Delux PsychoPy Builder demo.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;* Ensure a MilliKey Delux is connected to this computer and the light sensor is attached to the top left hand corner of the display.&amp;#10;* After connecting the MilliKey device, ensure you have run the &quot;autothreshold_millikey_delux_light_sensor.py&quot; script in Coder atleast once prior to running this demo for the first time.&amp;#10;   &amp;#10;Press the Space key to continue....&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Note: MilliKey Delux firmware version 1.5.5 or higher is required." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
